{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超早上在北京出席京港經濟合作研討洽談會開幕式，他表示，京港兩地可以在金融、培育人才及協助企業出海進一步加強合作，共同為國家高水平對外開放，作出更大貢獻。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.829215+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:49.395134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:48.445166+00:00","content_hash":"eda163d8134c3baa28fa75280a144705e02f5b4b74d4aaa0c3d158e6d459cb4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}